# Shared Data Block: Process_Data

## Data Block Overview
This shared data block contains global process variables used across multiple function blocks.

## Structure Definition

### Analog Inputs
```scl
STRUCT
    // Temperature sensors
    rTemp_Sensor_1 : REAL;    // Temperature sensor 1 (°C)
    rTemp_Sensor_2 : REAL;    // Temperature sensor 2 (°C)
    rTemp_Sensor_3 : REAL;    // Temperature sensor 3 (°C)
    
    // Pressure sensors
    rPressure_Sensor_1 : REAL; // Pressure sensor 1 (bar)
    rPressure_Sensor_2 : REAL; // Pressure sensor 2 (bar)
    
    // Flow sensors
    rFlow_Sensor_1 : REAL;    // Flow sensor 1 (L/min)
    rFlow_Sensor_2 : REAL;    // Flow sensor 2 (L/min)
    
    // Level sensors
    rLevel_Sensor_1 : REAL;   // Level sensor 1 (%)
    rLevel_Sensor_2 : REAL;   // Level sensor 2 (%)
END_STRUCT
```

### Digital Inputs
```scl
STRUCT
    // Limit switches
    bLimitSwitch_1 : BOOL;    // Limit switch 1
    bLimitSwitch_2 : BOOL;    // Limit switch 2
    bLimitSwitch_3 : BOOL;    // Limit switch 3
    
    // Push buttons
    bStart_PB : BOOL;         // Start push button
    bStop_PB : BOOL;          // Stop push button
    bReset_PB : BOOL;         // Reset push button
    
    // Selector switches
    bAuto_Manual : BOOL;      // Auto/Manual selector
    bLocal_Remote : BOOL;     // Local/Remote selector
END_STRUCT
```

### Digital Outputs
```scl
STRUCT
    // Motor controls
    bMotor_1_Run : BOOL;      // Motor 1 run command
    bMotor_2_Run : BOOL;      // Motor 2 run command
    bMotor_3_Run : BOOL;      // Motor 3 run command
    
    // Valve controls
    bValve_1_Open : BOOL;     // Valve 1 open command
    bValve_2_Open : BOOL;     // Valve 2 open command
    bValve_3_Open : BOOL;     // Valve 3 open command
    
    // Indicators
    bRunning_Ind : BOOL;      // Running indicator
    bFault_Ind : BOOL;        // Fault indicator
    bWarning_Ind : BOOL;      // Warning indicator
END_STRUCT
```

### Alarm Status
```scl
STRUCT
    // Alarm flags
    bHighTemp_Alarm : BOOL;   // High temperature alarm
    bLowTemp_Alarm : BOOL;    // Low temperature alarm
    bHighPressure_Alarm : BOOL; // High pressure alarm
    bLowPressure_Alarm : BOOL; // Low pressure alarm
    bHighLevel_Alarm : BOOL;  // High level alarm
    bLowLevel_Alarm : BOOL;   // Low level alarm
    
    // Alarm timestamps
    dtHighTemp_Time : DT;     // High temperature alarm time
    dtLowTemp_Time : DT;      // Low temperature alarm time
    dtHighPressure_Time : DT; // High pressure alarm time
END_STRUCT
```

## Access Paths
- DB: Process_Data
- Symbolic name: "Process_Data"
- Access: Read/Write from all blocks

## Initial Values
- All REAL variables: 0.0
- All BOOL variables: FALSE
- All DT variables: DT#1970-01-01-00:00:00

## Data Block Size
- Total size: Approximately 200 bytes
- Optimize access: Yes
- Retentive: No

## Usage Notes
- This data block is shared across all function blocks
- Update cycle: Every PLC scan
- Data consistency: Ensured by atomic access
- Watchdog: Monitored for data integrity
